WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.134
In this video, you will find displays that a professional lighting company installed, and look at the company behind them.

00:00:07.134 --> 00:00:08.229
We start on the map.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:13.192
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.192 --> 00:00:15.317
That is the only address you need.

00:00:17.911 --> 00:00:20.318
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:20.318 --> 00:00:24.062
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:24.062 --> 00:00:25.399
Tap Use my location.

00:00:27.231 --> 00:00:31.668
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:34.873
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:34.873 --> 00:00:39.433
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:43.103 --> 00:00:44.426
Tap the season button.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.640
Pick the one you want.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:55.035
Christmas lights are the biggest, so tap Thanksgiving and Christmas Lights.

00:00:55.035 --> 00:00:58.504
Halloween, New Year, and other seasons are in the same list.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.397
Tap Filters.

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:05.855
Under Type, tap Professionally installed.

00:01:05.855 --> 00:01:12.801
This shows only displays that a lighting company put up, which is great if you are thinking of hiring one for your own house.

00:01:15.115 --> 00:01:17.163
Tap the red button to show the places.

00:01:20.361 --> 00:01:21.862
Open one of the places.

00:01:21.862 --> 00:01:24.803
It says Installed by, with the company's name.

00:01:24.803 --> 00:01:27.806
A check mark means the company has confirmed it.

00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:32.942
Tap the company's name to open its profile.

00:01:35.538 --> 00:01:37.259
This is the company's profile.

00:01:37.259 --> 00:01:45.756
It lists where they work, their phone number, and their website, along with every display they have installed, so you can see their work before you call.

00:01:46.959 --> 00:01:49.241
Next up: Enter your home in a contest.
